// Browser Started with Remote Debugging | T1185 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_browsers_remote_debugging.yml
process.command_line:*\ \-\-remote\-debugging\-* OR (process.executable.caseless:*\\firefox.exe AND process.command_line:*\ \-start\-debugger\-server*)
